00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:34.133
Good, double up again.

00:11:35.616 --> 00:11:37.199
Why, I want haters.

00:11:38.775 --> 00:11:42.314
So, we started sending out one every week,

00:11:42.314 --> 00:11:43.716
and then I start a Twitter account.

00:11:43.716 --> 00:11:46.802
I actually had people
write, "Grant Cardone,"

00:11:46.802 --> 00:11:49.569
social media people, "Grant
Cardone is an example

00:11:49.569 --> 00:11:53.019
"of what not to do with social media."

00:11:53.019 --> 00:11:56.373
I said, freaking, just multiply.

00:11:56.373 --> 00:11:57.760
(audience laughing)

00:11:57.760 --> 00:12:01.186
Just increase it, we were
doing like four Tweets a day.

00:12:01.186 --> 00:12:03.580
Good, do two an hour.

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:06.248
Why, because I want my
competition hating my guts,

00:12:06.248 --> 00:12:07.462
I want them talking about me.

00:12:07.462 --> 00:12:09.021
I mean, I don't really
want people to hate me,

00:12:09.021 --> 00:12:10.349
you understand what I'm saying about.

00:12:10.349 --> 00:12:13.249
I want them so energized that they

00:12:13.249 --> 00:12:17.416
actually start pushing me,
they start promoting me.

00:12:18.293 --> 00:12:20.150
I use everyone of the news channels.

00:12:20.150 --> 00:12:22.527
You'll see me on TV
doing news one day, okay.

00:12:22.527 --> 00:12:25.194
I don't watch news, I make news.

00:12:26.268 --> 00:12:29.217
See the shift, you see the slight shift?

00:12:29.217 --> 00:12:30.967
Don't watch the news.

00:12:31.854 --> 00:12:34.577
Decide when you leave here
today to make the news.

00:12:34.577 --> 00:12:38.744
You don't read the newspaper,
you write newspaper articles.

00:12:41.636 --> 00:12:42.908
You don't read books.

00:12:42.908 --> 00:12:45.658
Yeah, read them, but learn to write them.

00:12:45.658 --> 00:12:49.111
You don't need to spend a
lifetime writing a book,

00:12:49.111 --> 00:12:51.646
this was three hours.

00:12:51.646 --> 00:12:54.159
Okay, we sold 40,000
copies of this one book

00:12:54.159 --> 00:12:55.428
and it was self published.

00:12:55.428 --> 00:12:59.011
It's never, ever, ever
been in a bookstore.

00:13:00.402 --> 00:13:02.525
A guy writes me, says, "Hey,
you got misspelled words

00:13:02.525 --> 00:13:03.675
"all in that book."

00:13:03.675 --> 00:13:05.408
