00:13:05.408 --> 00:13:08.569
I'm like, "Yeah, so what, where are they?"

00:13:08.569 --> 00:13:10.319
"123, 128, 134, 165."

00:13:11.943 --> 00:13:13.980
I'm like, "Yeah, yeah."

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:15.865
And bad grammar, too.

00:13:15.865 --> 00:13:19.646
I'm like, "Yeah, what's your point, dude?

00:13:19.646 --> 00:13:23.049
"What's your point, man, why
do you keep telling me that?"

00:13:23.049 --> 00:13:24.023
He's like, "Because man,

00:13:24.023 --> 00:13:25.002
"you got misspelled words in the book."

00:13:25.002 --> 00:13:27.770
It's a bestseller (beep).

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:31.765
(audience laughing and applauding)

00:13:31.765 --> 00:13:33.967
Okay, so what, it ain't
best written, okay.

00:13:33.967 --> 00:13:36.717
