00:13:37.884 --> 00:13:40.766
I don't want you to think
that that's a cuss word.

00:13:40.766 --> 00:13:42.236
The word (beep), look
it up in the dictionary,

00:13:42.236 --> 00:13:46.408
it means a complainer, or
whiner, and excuse maker.

00:13:46.408 --> 00:13:50.211
I wear a little band on my
pin here, on my wrist here,

00:13:50.211 --> 00:13:54.378
it's a little black band and
it says, "Champions dominate."

