00:14:05.939 --> 00:14:07.227
the excuse makers.

00:14:07.227 --> 00:14:09.292
Oh, my god, it's the market.

00:14:09.292 --> 00:14:13.390
It's the market, oh my
god, prices, inventory!

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:16.469
Nine months ago, there's
too much inventory,

00:14:16.469 --> 00:14:18.552
