00:14:20.448 --> 00:14:24.752
Dude, human beings have so many
excuses, it's unbelievable.

00:14:24.752 --> 00:14:25.821
You know why?

00:14:25.821 --> 00:14:27.576
Because you watch the news too much.

00:14:27.576 --> 00:14:31.743
Because you've agreed to
receive news, not make news.

00:14:32.604 --> 00:14:35.485
- My journalism professor
said the money will come,

00:14:35.485 --> 00:14:38.223
follow your heart, follow your
passion, the money will come.

00:14:38.223 --> 00:14:39.219
That's what was told to me.

00:14:39.219 --> 00:14:40.679
