00:14:40.679 --> 00:14:43.681
otherwise he wouldn't
have been in his job.

00:14:43.681 --> 00:14:44.839
- [Woman] You mean as a professor?

00:14:44.839 --> 00:14:47.720
- He should not have been
giving you advice on money.

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:50.391
He doesn't have any
money, you've got people--

00:14:50.391 --> 00:14:52.142
- But if his measurement
of success is not money

00:14:52.142 --> 00:14:53.549
and it's prestige or--

00:14:53.549 --> 00:14:55.559
- Then why's he giving
you advice on money?

00:14:55.559 --> 00:14:56.743
That's my point.

00:14:56.743 --> 00:14:59.266
My dad, my dad died when he was 52.

00:14:59.266 --> 00:15:01.762
He made it in the middle class.

00:15:01.762 --> 00:15:03.378
My mom and my dad thought they had made it

00:15:03.378 --> 00:15:05.311
when the truth is the next week,

00:15:05.311 --> 00:15:08.663
my mom had to sell the house
he bought so we could live.

00:15:08.663 --> 00:15:10.733
That is not making it, okay.

00:15:10.733 --> 00:15:12.369
You should not get your
advice from people in

00:15:12.369 --> 00:15:15.080
the middle class about finances.

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:17.576
They don't know anything about finances.

00:15:17.576 --> 00:15:21.743
If you know what day it is,
you are not busy enough.

00:15:22.841 --> 00:15:25.811
I recently heard, this
week, oh, it's Monday,

00:15:25.811 --> 00:15:28.599
man, it's so hard to
get started on a Monday.

00:15:28.599 --> 00:15:30.429
I'm like, "How do you
even know it's Monday?"

00:15:30.429 --> 00:15:31.737
I don't know what day it is.

00:15:31.737 --> 00:15:35.206
On Wednesday, we hear it's hump back day,

00:15:35.206 --> 00:15:36.983
we're halfway there.

00:15:36.983 --> 00:15:40.308
So, it's Friday and it's like,
oh, thank god it's Friday,

00:15:40.308 --> 00:15:41.926
or follow Friday, or like,

00:15:41.926 --> 00:15:45.368
dude, how do you people
know what day it is?

00:15:45.368 --> 00:15:48.215
You're not busy enough, you
need to be so freaking busy

00:15:48.215 --> 00:15:51.264
that you don't know what time it is,

00:15:51.264 --> 00:15:52.671
you don't know if it's
before lunch, after lunch,

00:15:52.671 --> 00:15:53.939
before dinner, after dinner.

00:15:53.939 --> 00:15:55.479
Come on, you've had those productive days.

00:15:55.479 --> 00:15:58.054
Remember the day when
you were so productive,

00:15:58.054 --> 00:16:01.095
you literally worked
through lunch and dinner

00:16:01.095 --> 00:16:02.648
and you looked up at 7:00,

00:16:02.648 --> 00:16:04.738
