00:16:04.738 --> 00:16:06.342
And you're like, dude, I
hadn't had lunch or dinner.

00:16:06.342 --> 00:16:07.723
You know why?

00:16:07.723 --> 00:16:11.330
Because that day, you were
eating the marketplace,

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:14.305
