00:16:14.305 --> 00:16:17.265
you were active, productive,
hitting it, slamming,

00:16:17.265 --> 00:16:20.463
creative, and completely committed.

00:16:20.463 --> 00:16:22.235
Look, that's where you need to be today.

00:16:22.235 --> 00:16:25.183
Look, I don't know what
Monday, Wednesday, or Friday,

00:16:25.183 --> 00:16:28.250
or I don't know about
Saturdays and Sundays.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:30.446
I know this, create tremendous
amounts of activity,

00:16:30.446 --> 00:16:34.196
so much activity that
you lose track of time.

00:16:35.427 --> 00:16:38.432
Your success is not going
to come from watching TV

00:16:38.432 --> 00:16:41.129
