that you don't know about,

00:16:48.039 --> 00:16:50.792
oh my gosh, it's the Monday morning blues,

00:16:50.792 --> 00:16:53.792
or Wednesday humpback, or Friday what?

00:16:53.792 --> 00:16:56.464
(loud drumming)
Friday what, whatever!

00:16:56.464 --> 00:16:57.297
Okay, get busy.

00:16:57.297 --> 00:17:00.812
At different places in
life, I promise you,

00:17:00.812 --> 00:17:05.083
