00:18:25.972 --> 00:18:28.696
And then what I try to do
is I try to help one person,

00:18:28.696 --> 00:18:30.245
one person.

00:18:30.245 --> 00:18:33.648
And what happened over
the period of 34 years,

00:18:33.648 --> 00:18:36.144
I did that everyday, I'm
not depressed anymore,

00:18:36.144 --> 00:18:38.290
