00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:39.852
I don't use any kind of medication,

00:18:39.852 --> 00:18:42.227
don't use any kind of
drugs, don't smoke weed,

00:18:42.227 --> 00:18:44.515
don't drink, excessively drink,

00:18:44.515 --> 00:18:46.559
