00:19:14.063 --> 00:19:15.054
No, no I don't.

00:19:15.054 --> 00:19:17.476
This is what I do, I do things, I show up,

00:19:17.476 --> 00:19:19.693
move in the direction,
I don't overanalyze,

00:19:19.693 --> 00:19:23.385
